# cerne.pro brand theme for Ghostty — "sapwood" (light)
# Tokens from ~/Documents/design-guidelines. Per the guidelines' own note,
# amber (heartwood) fails contrast on light backgrounds, so oxblood stands
# in as the accent/red throughout. All ANSI text slots verified >=4.5:1
# against the #ECEBE6 background (WCAG AA); red/green/white/bright-red
# reuse brand tokens directly, the rest are darkened tints of the dark
# theme's hues to stay legible as dark-on-light text.

